  "grading": {
    "retrieval": "A retrieved chunk is relevant when its section_id is listed in supporting_sections. If chunk_index is set, the relevant chunk is that index within the section.",
    "answer": "Score an answer against answer_must_include, case-insensitive. expected_answer is the reference wording. When abstain is true, a correct answer declines and does not invent a figure or a name.",
    "distractors": "distractor_sections contain a competing figure or a lookalike passage. They are not relevant for the question as asked."
  },
